ft:27pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-27pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">(1)</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:13.02pt">Amounts reported for Mr. Wallinger in 2024 were earned in his capacity as an independent contractor and represent fees paid to him in such capacity. Mr. Wallinger transitioned to an employee of the Company on September 1, 2025. Amounts reported in this column for fiscal year 2025 represent $333,000 received in Mr. Wallinger&#8217;s capacity as an independent contractor and $167,000 received in his capacity as an employee of the Company.  </font></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-27pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(2)</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:15.34pt">The amounts reported in the &#8220;Non-Equity Incentive Plan Compensation&#8221; column represent annual cash incentive awards earned by our Named Executive Officers during the applicable fiscal year.</font></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-27pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(3)</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:13.02pt">The amounts reported in the &#8220;All Other Compensation&#8221; column represent $54 paid by the Company for general life insurance premiums for each of our Named Executive Officers and Company contributions to our 401(k) plan on behalf of Messrs. Messerle and Rudra in the amount of $16,098 and $8,728, respectively for 2024 and $4,618 and $11,292, for 2025, respectively.</font></di